<title>USA: Goodyear sees Sava deal aiding Europe opers.</title>
<headline>Goodyear sees Sava deal aiding Europe opers.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goodyear Tire &amp; Rubber Co said on Wednesday that its planned joint venture with Sava's engineered products business provides the springboard to grow the company's presence in Europe.</p>
<p>Majority ownership in Slovenia-based Sava fits Goodyear's plans to expand beyond North America, the company said.</p>
<p>Goodyear agreed on May 19 to take a 60 percent stake in Sava's tire business and a 75 percent stake in its engineered products unit, the company said.</p>
<p>Goodyear will use Sava to manufacture transportation hose, air springs and power transmission products, it said.</p>
